      en: "The Seychelles Institute of Art and Design (SIAD) in Au Cap, Mahé, is a tertiary institution dedicated to arts and design. Founded in 2005, it offers diplomas in fine arts, graphic design, fashion, and photography. The campus features modern studios, galleries, and workshops. SIAD nurtures local talent and supports the creative economy of Seychelles. It regularly hosts exhibitions and cultural events open to the public, enriching the nation's cultural landscape. The institute operates under the Ministry of Education.",
